WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Guile activates Drive Impact against Ryu’s incoming DI.

2
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.550
Guile’s DI wins and crumples Ryu.

3
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.150
Down-forward heavy kick hits during the crumple.

4
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.600
Heavy Somersault Kick finishes the conversion.

5
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:05.850
Ryu lands after the counter-DI route.
